      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ねえ、ちょっと思ったんだけど……。\r\n氷刃はなんでこんな場所に\r\n闇のクリスタルを移したのかな。",
        "official_en": "So I’ve been thinking...I still don’t get why Gelidus moved the Dark Crystal to a place like this.",
        "real_en": "So I’ve been thinking...I still don’t get why Frost Blade Veritas moved the Dark Crystal to a place like this."
      },
