      "text": {
        "jp": "石碑には\r\n「大いなる息吹に備え、限られた時間の中で戦いを組み立てよ」\r\nって書いてある……。",
        "official_en": "“Impending is a breath most immense—use your time wisely, and prepare your defense.”",
        "real_en": "The tablet says... 'Prepare for a mighty breath, and plan your fight within the time allowed.'"
